## Project Feature
research-ai/
├── configs/                 # 配置文件
│   ├── roles/               # 角色专属配置
│   │   ├── literature.yaml  # 文献分析角色参数
│   │   └── writer.yaml      # 论文撰写参数
│   └── llm_config.yaml      # 模型API配置
├── core/
│   ├── agents/              # 所有角色实现
|   |—— rag/                 # 这里是核心加载文件以及对文件元数据进行RAG并且测试的文件
│   ├── services/            # 核心服务
│   │   ├── rag_service.py   # Retrival服务
│   │   └── vec_retrivers
│   └── models/              # 数据模型
├── utils/
│   ├── prompt_templates/    # Prompt模板库
│   └── file_processor.py    # 文件解析（PDF/Tex/代码）
├── api/
│   ├── app.py               # FastAPI主入口
│   └── routers/             # 路由模块
|        |-----chat.py
|
|—— tests/
    - test_llm
    - test_api
## Setup
### set python path
like:   export PYTHONPATH=/Users/username/ExHelper:$PYTHONPATH  ### modify Exhelper as a module of RA
export PYTHONPATH=/Users/username/ResearchAssistant:$PYTHONPATH

### create a python env
python -m venv exhelper
source exhelper/bin/activate

### install requirements
pip install -r requirements.txt


### set llm and keyß
In the config/llm_config.json, I have set a one and you can modify to yours.

### notes:
1.run some test in tests module, both agents and  llm_api and retrieval. Make sure they can run smoothly.
2.You can build artical_vectors by run test, or unzip the article_vectors.npy.zip.
3.If you want to run both python and java, go to "project structure" and set the interpreters.